URL: https://downloads.xiph.org/releases/ogg/libogg-1.3.5.tar.xz 3f6c106afa5b026ca7b8a0cc56fdb100bf2f93aee5c84f46beec4c7e1fe6c452
Origname: libogg-1.3.5
Name: libogg

    libogg 1.3.5 (the Ogg container bitstream library).  Built for
    libvorbis (postlc12), which libcanberra (postlc12) hard-requires at
    configure time (PKG_CHECK_MODULES(VORBIS, [vorbisfile]) with no
    required:false -- the vorbis sound-file reader in
    src/read-sound-file.c is unconditional), and libcanberra-gtk3 is in
    turn an UNCONDITIONAL dependency of gdm 46.2 (meson.build:66,
    used by utils/gdm-screenshot).  Classic autotools, plain C -- zero
    Fil-C patches expected.
